---
// The "photo of the trip" in the morning-after mock: the group on the jetty at sunset.
// A real photo (generated for the site), cropped to the card's 16/11 in public/.
// Serves public/lakehouse.webp directly — the <img> below is its only presentation,
// so the page's role="img" + aria-label keeps the accessible name in index.astro.
---

<img
  class="lake-photo"
  src="/lakehouse.webp"
  width="1344"
  height="924"
  alt=""
  aria-hidden="true"
  fetchpriority="high"
  decoding="async"
/>

<style>
  .lake-photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
</style>
